{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5001_p", "source_sha256": "bef9f645aee27f09f618dceff0dd403a818b4e8cd1e2f02a079cfd29262ff0be", "ja": "（レポートのテーマは学校帰りの寄り道スポット。\n制服も用意してもらって、雰囲気もばっちりだ！）", "zh": "（报告的主题是放学回家路上的顺道去处。还请人准备了制服，氛围也恰到好处！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5002_007ior", "source_sha256": "52abd1156d8bb22974f3ecf0ec582f02e879a70ac0e88e395b4f26766a85f4a7", "ja": "へぇ、今日はたい焼き屋さんを紹介するのね。\nん～♪　この焼きたての匂い、たまらないわ。", "zh": "哦，今天要介绍的是鲷鱼烧店呀。\n嗯～♪这刚出炉的香味，真让人受不了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5003_p", "source_sha256": "50260bc8b64e64905e7c7dd66e7ad34e646ecd0e573a1748352afa92a5eebc37", "ja": "学校帰りについつい買い食いしたくなるたい焼き……。\n中身も色々あるみたいだけど、どれをレポートする？", "zh": "放学路上总会忍不住想买来吃的鲷鱼烧……\n馅料好像也有好几种，要介绍哪一种呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5004_007ior", "source_sha256": "b60ee407b0e89bcc41b4e8dd2c84355fae9b9141feb5dd6b07affdb67e02e979", "ja": "そうね……。アンタのセンスをテストしてあげるわ♪\nこの中だと、定番と変わり種……どっちがいいかしら？", "zh": "是啊……就来测试一下你的品味吧♪\n这里面，经典口味和特别口味……你觉得选哪个比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5005_p", "source_sha256": "56c1311e2a322790afc5ad681cb89f8b8c6c3359de59526848348013c28868d9", "ja": "定番と、変わり種か。\nうーん、そうだな。それなら……", "zh": "经典款，和奇特款吗。\n嗯——也是呢。那样的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5007", "source_sha256": "c2e5ca887de100aa4795b3bc75d071220d678c4c247e6e584816582555ff4585", "ja": "定番", "zh": "经典", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5008", "source_sha256": "58ff8e2e2ab3f38bcb6b916f57c0a0c92a93bb2e81310abbbb99f22749e90fcc", "ja": "変わり種", "zh": "另类", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5200_p", "source_sha256": "d9494aed87c6a013dedb7e63e58f4b20f09bcb6c02472fe032e18be0a42c0c17", "ja": "やっぱり、ここはシンプルに\n定番のあんこがいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "果然这种时候就该选简单的，\n经典的豆沙馅不是挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5201_007ior", "source_sha256": "29c1c7c3004ad3cf427ca85c0d03591c0626de1ac0622d394a2d719259479d21", "ja": "ふふっ、悪くない選択ね。たしかに、\nシンプルなほうが、味の違いもはっきり出るものね。", "zh": "呵呵，不错的选择嘛。确实，越简单越能清楚地品出味道的差别呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5202_007ior", "source_sha256": "f026b475cfb35431994e47067b02d7a3417a22adc4b9b3ba5783934ea997a4dc", "ja": "なかなか頼りになるじゃない！\nこれからも伊織ちゃんのために、頑張りなさいよね♪", "zh": "还挺靠得住的嘛！今后也要为了伊织继续努力哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5300_p", "source_sha256": "0bad3c74f1c234fdcd48d77c99acf022a7c36e8565338ac15f6b0d7b5c34c59c", "ja": "やっぱり、ここはシンプルに\n定番のあんこがいいんじゃないか。", "zh": "这里果然还是简单一点，\n选经典的红豆馅比较好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5301_007ior", "source_sha256": "bc26cd33342b21db841322c8852b90d258445970948378ee485051e7d7e27ea6", "ja": "うーん、ちょっと無難すぎる気もするけど……\nま、それぐらいのほうが、分かりやすくていいかもね。", "zh": "嗯……感觉有点太稳妥了……\n不过，这样反而更简单明了，或许也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5302_007ior", "source_sha256": "9b48dbaeac0bd62ff5a36bd223d5e18b18835cf7005d790cd5145ca8da58af8a", "ja": "それに、定番ものこそ、レポートの腕の見せ所よね。\n伊織ちゃんの華麗な仕事ぶり、見てなさい♪", "zh": "而且，正因为是经典内容，才更能展现写报告的本事嘛。\n看好了，伊织小姐华丽的工作表现哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5500_p", "source_sha256": "6f202a4dbdf8201646713d606a8f8f7f7bbf963e78d0c5ffc00ed1db0ddbf898", "ja": "変わり種にチャレンジするのもいいんじゃないか？\n視聴者も興味あるだろうし……。", "zh": "挑战一下特别的品种不也挺好的吗？\n观众应该也会很感兴趣的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5501_007ior", "source_sha256": "ca91f563aa1b474915d40f977c4911bac51f57609d16cfbf93c1042ed00da1ef", "ja": "ふふん、分かってるじゃない♪　どんなに\nおいしくても、同じのばかりじゃ飽きちゃうわよね。", "zh": "哼哼，你还挺懂的嘛♪　再怎么好吃，总是吃同一种也会腻的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5502_007ior", "source_sha256": "9c3a4059a9c1387f9620f59bd62f345239ca4e86abfd7ec5a507158af5249635", "ja": "それじゃ、気になったメニューから注文していくわよ。\nアンタも半分、食べなさいよね！", "zh": "那就从感兴趣的菜单开始点吧。\n你也要吃一半哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5600_p", "source_sha256": "6f202a4dbdf8201646713d606a8f8f7f7bbf963e78d0c5ffc00ed1db0ddbf898", "ja": "変わり種にチャレンジするのもいいんじゃないか？\n視聴者も興味あるだろうし……。", "zh": "挑战一下特别的品种不也挺好的吗？\n观众应该也会很感兴趣的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5601_007ior", "source_sha256": "7c073003a506678cdf972c1136151f2e99ecd9109d9ab70d04a516c75677d59c", "ja": "まあ、アンタが言うなら試してみてもいいけど……。\nライスたい焼き、ゴーヤたい焼き、ウニたい焼き……？", "zh": "嘛，既然你这么说，试试也不是不可以……米饭鲷鱼烧、苦瓜鲷鱼烧、海胆鲷鱼烧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_007ior_5000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_007ior_5602_007ior", "source_sha256": "c89d686d39e18545a633cf8b9682ed73c81d25cf801c52887b0ba3ba3bec61c5", "ja": "あ、アンタが先に味見しなさいよね！\n伊織ちゃんのために働けるんだから、嬉しいでしょ♪", "zh": "啊，你先尝一口啦！\n能为伊织工作，你应该很开心吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
